;"}, {"a": 15.145, "b": 18.782, "x": "Our helper He, amid the flood"}, {"a": 18.782, "b": 22.418, "x": "of mortal ills prevailing."}, {"a": 22.418, "b": 29.691, "x": "For still our ancient foe doth seek to work us woe;"}, {"a": 29.691, "b": 36.964, "x": "His craft and power are great, and armed with cruel hate,"}, {"a": 36.964, "b": 40.6, "x": "On earth is not his equal."}, {"a": 40.6, "b": 44.236, "x": "Did we in our own strength confide,"}, {"a": 44.236, "b": 47.873, "x": "our striving would be losing;"}, {"a": 47.873, "b": 51.509, "x": "Were not the right Man on our side,"}, {"a": 51.509, "b": 55.145, "x": "the Man of God's own choosing:"}, {"a": 55.145, "b": 62.418, "x": "Dost ask who that may be? Christ Jesus, it is He;"}, {"a": 62.418, "b": 69.691, "x": "Lord Sabaoth His name, from age to age the same,"}, {"a": 69.691, "b": 73.327, "x": "And He must win the battle."}, {"a": 73.327, "b": 76.964, "x": "That word above all earthly powers,"}, {"a": 76.964, "b": 80.6, "x": "no thanks to them, abideth;"}, {"a": 80.6, "b": 84.236, "x": "The Spirit and the gifts are ours"}, {"a": 84.236, "b": 87.873, "x": "through Him who with us sideth:"}, {"a": 87.873, "b": 95.145, "x": "Let goods and kindred go, this mortal life also;"}, {"a": 95.145, "b": 102.418, "x": "The body they may kill: God's truth abideth still,"}, {"a": 102.418, "b": 106.055, "x": "His kingdom is forever."}], "lanes": {"KIDS": 3}, "chords": [[1.0545, 4, "min"], [1.9636, 7, "maj"], [2.8727, 9, "min"], [3.7818, 7, "maj"], [4.6909, 4, "min"], [5.6, 0, "maj"], [6.5091, 4, "min"], [7.4182, 0, "maj"], [8.3273, 4, "min"], [9.2364, 7, "maj"], [10.1455, 9, "min"], [11.0545, 7, "maj"], [11.9636, 4, "min"], [12.8727, 0, "maj"], [13.7818, 2, "min"], [14.6909, 0, "maj"], [15.6, 4, "min"], [16.5091, 7, "maj"], [17.4182, 9, "min"], [18.3273, 7, "maj"], [19.2364, 4, "min"], [20.1455, 0, "maj"], [21.0545, 2, "min"], [21.9636, 0, "maj"], [22.8727, 0, "maj"], [23.7818, 11, "min"], [24.6909, 7, "maj"], [26.5091, 11, "min"], 